{
  "_comment": "Octail curated egg (plan §6.4). Based on games-standalone factorio/factorio/egg-factorio.yaml (pelican-eggs, MIT licence), converted to JSON. Octail changes the install script (the headless release checked against the SHA-256 list factorio.com publishes, a version that isn't listed fails the install, failures exit non-zero, and a reinstall no longer overwrites data/map-settings.json: upstream looked for it in the wrong folder) and adds RCON on an automatic port with a generated password (RCON on by default, Factorio's own RCON exec path rather than Source's: see tentacle/src/rcon/factorio.js), generic UDP idle sleep (off until staff enable it per server), a broadcast command (plain console text is chat), a Players tab over `/players online`/`/kick`/`/ban`/`/unban` with unquoted names (Factorio's console doesn't respect quotes), install sandbox defaults and resource hints.",
